<h3><u>Mujhe paidal chalna</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Mujhe paidal chalna</u></strong></p>

<p>(Ya hussain) x2</p>

<p>Zindaan se riha hokar jis dam</p>

<p>Jab karbobala mei aaye haram</p>

<p>Naaqe se giri Zainab dukhiyaa</p>

<p>Aur zakhmi zakhmi rakhti qadam</p>

<p>Rokar ghazi se kehne lagi</p>

<p>Baba ne mujhe samjhaaya tha</p>

<p>Ay beti ghar mei paidal chal</p>

<p>Chalna hai tujhe meelo(n) tanha</p>

<p>(O mere ghazi ghayrat waale) x2</p>

<p>Haan meri chadar ke rakhwaale</p>

<p>Haan mujhe ghir ke sambhalna aagaya</p>

<p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

<p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>

<ol>
 <li>Mashk-o-alam wale mere
 <p>Shahe wafa awaaz de</p>

 <p>Ummul baneen ke laadle</p>

 <p>Har gham se guzarna aagaya</p>

 <p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

 <p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Qendhi thi ro pai serheenye
 <p>Majboor wo teri bherheeye</p>

 <p>Na gar jise de panrheeye</p>

 <p>Jiwe zalim rassiyaa(n) paagaya</p>

 <p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

 <p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Le shaam se mei aagayi
 <p>Ghazi mei kyu zinda rahi</p>

 <p>Saaya tha na meelo(n) koi</p>

 <p>Mujhe dhoop mei chalna aagaya</p>

 <p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

 <p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Dukhi bheyr da, ghazi bhiraa(n)
 <p>Hur(n) ki karaa(n), Menu desa</p>

 <p>Chali veer ve, mei berida</p>

 <p>Tera jarnraa(n) mar muka gaya</p>

 <p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

 <p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Dekhe saje ada ke ghar
 <p>Nezo(n) pe the pyaaro(n) ke sar</p>

 <p>Tukre huwa mera jigar</p>

 <p>Mujhe yaad Madina aagaya</p>

 <p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

 <p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Gaya dard ay dil cheer ay
 <p>Vekhi zulam, di akheer ay</p>

 <p>Wich zulm di, zanjeer de</p>

 <p>Rukh bapardah hai khaagaya</p>

 <p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

 <p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Bazaar tha darbaar tha
 <p>Zanjeer thi, beemar tha</p>

 <p>Jeena mera dushwaar tha</p>

 <p>Har dard ko sehna aagaya</p>

 <p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

 <p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>La la nuwe, jaara(n) tera
 <p>Wich shaam de, jaraa(n) tera</p>

 <p>Sang zulm de, khora(n) tera</p>

 <p>&quot;Khursheed&quot; nu neer rawagaya</p>

 <p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

 <p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Ay &quot;Sarwar-o-Rehan&quot; ab</li>
</ol>

<p>Socho zara kya tha ghazab</p>

<p>Bint-e-Ali kehti thi jab</p>

<p>Mujhe jeena marna aagaya</p>

<p>Haan mujhe paidal chalna aagaya, Abbas</p>

<p>(Meko paidal turna aagaya, Abbas) x2</p>
</p>